│                          │ maximizing Σr subject to border-distance and pairwise-distance constraints is a linear    │
│                          │ program solved exactly via scipy, with a converged multi-pass scaler as fallback.         │
│                          │ Expected sum ≈ 2.6+, near the AlphaEvolve target of 2.635.                                │
