│                          │ the 0.86-scoring version). Fix 2: add a final greedy "growth pass" — after the            │
│                          │ hill-climb, try small single-coordinate shifts for each circle, re-solve the exact LP,    │
│                          │ and keep any strict improvement, with shrinking step sizes. Since the LP gives the exact  │
│                          │ optimal radii for given centers, any center move that helps is directly measurable; this  │
│                          │ polishes irregular placements the random hill-climb misses, at a modest LP-solve cost.    │
