│                          │ program (as in the 2.44-scoring program) rather than water-filling, and centers are       │
│                          │ refined by a deterministic constraint-repulsion hill-climb (as in the 2.45 program),      │
│                          │ re-solving the LP each round. Multiple structured seeds are tried and the best is         │
│                          │ returned, improving robustness without relying on a single fragile layout.                │
