│ patch_description        │ Crossover of the two programs. The current program's hexagonal staggered lattice seed     │
│                          │ (which scores 2.44 with uniform radii) is kept as the starting layout, but the radii are  │
│                          │ no longer forced uniform: the crossover program adopts the second implementation's exact  │
│                          │ LP solver (scipy linprog) that maximizes the sum of radii at fixed centers, with a        │
│                          │ proportional-scaling fallback. Additionally, a light vectorized relaxation step (from the │
│                          │ second program, with fewer iterations for speed) polishes the lattice positions before    │
│                          │ the LP, letting corner/edge circles expand. This combines the better seed geometry of the │
│                          │ current program with the better radius optimization of the crossover inspiration, while   │
│                          │ staying fast.                                                                             │
