│ patch_description        │ Add diagonal (±delta/√2, ±delta/√2) shift candidates to `_local_shift_search`.            │
│                          │ Corner-region circles are often limited by three constraints (two walls + one neighbor);  │
│                          │ moving along axes wastes one constraint's slack, while diagonal moves toward/away from    │
│                          │ corners can increase the three-way limited radius. Warm-started re-solves make each extra │
│                          │ candidate nearly free and the eval budget (0.33s vs presumably ~few-second cap) has       │
│                          │ headroom. Also add mixed (±delta, ±delta) full-size diagonal moves for stronger escape    │
│                          │ from local minima.                                                                        │
